{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CALL YOUR &quot;FRIENDS&quot; FOR A BEATDOWN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players brawl for the legendary Lunara Mask! Fight your buddies with honor or play dirty in this chaotic clash \u2014 perfect for pizza night!<br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/image2.gif?t=1746567350\" /> <br> <br><strong>NEW STAGE, NEW CHALLENGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As if backstabbing buddies weren\u2019t enough, each level throws in a wild twist that can turn the tide at any moment! Battle it out while dodging deadly lasers or surviving a ravenous, platform-devouring tornado! Every stage brings a brand-new surprise!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/image3.gif?t=1746567350\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TIRED OF BRAWLING? TIME FOR SPORTS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form teams and face off in frantic matches ranging from soccer to basketball! Not really into sports? No worries \u2014 you can still smack your buddies around and mess up the game!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/image4.gif?t=1746567350\" /><br><br><br><strong>FROM SAMURAI TO DRAGON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a diverse and charismatic cast of characters and punch your opponents in the face \u2014 in the most stylish way possible!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/image5.gif?t=1746567350\" /><br><br><strong>SIMPLE CHAOS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This party\u2019s for everyone! With simple, intuitive controls, you don\u2019t need to be a Twitch champion to have fun in this wildly inviting chaos. At the same time, platforming veterans will find a rich stage to showcase their skills and flow across the screen with speed and style.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/image1.gif?t=1746567350\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709180?t=1746567350","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709180?t=1746567350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/65ec5d0a4443c27f51d0b3003dfd499874b0254f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746567350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/65ec5d0a4443c27f51d0b3003dfd499874b0254f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746567350","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CALL YOUR &quot;FRIENDS&quot; FOR A BEATDOWN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players brawl for the legendary Lunara Mask! Fight your buddies with honor or play dirty in this chaotic clash \u2014 perfect for pizza night!<br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709180/extras/image2.gif?t=1746567350\" /> <br> <br><strong>NEW STAGE, NEW CHALLENGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As if backstabbing buddies weren\u2019t enough, each level throws in a wild twist that can turn the tide at any moment! Battle it out while dodging deadly lasers or surviving a ravenous, platform-devouring tor